{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a Shopify OS 2.0 liquid block: "Collection carousel with static cards".
    
    WRAPPER: overflow: visible everywhere. No overflow: hidden on any element. Track: overflow-x: auto, overflow-y: visible, scroll-snap-type: x mandatory, -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch, scrollbar hidden. Track padding: 20px 8vw.
    
    PROGRESSIVE SCALE (most important): On every scroll frame via requestAnimationFrame, calculate each card's distance from track center using getBoundingClientRect(). Apply: scale = clamp(1.0 - (distance/trackWidth)*0.18, 0.82, 1.0) and opacity = clamp(1.0 - (distance/trackWidth)*0.28, 0.72, 1.0). Set via card.style.transform and card.style.opacity. Card CSS transition: transform 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.25,0.46,0.45,0.94), opacity 0.25s ease. After 150ms scroll debounce, snap nearest card to center with scrollBy({behavior:'smooth'}). Use isSnapping flag, release after 400ms.
    
    CARDS 1–3 — Collection (dynamic): Collection picker per card. Show: featured image (object-fit:cover), title (collection.title | default:'Colección', no number), optional description (checkbox toggle), button → collection.url.
    
    CARDS 4–5 — Static (custom): Per card: image_picker, text heading (default "Título"), text button label (default "Ver más"), url button link. No description. Visually identical to collection cards.
    
    CARD CSS: flex-shrink:0, scroll-snap-align:center, display:flex, flex-direction:column, overflow:hidden.
    
    SCHEMA SETTINGS:
    
    Mobile card width: range min 55 max 90 step 1 unit vw default 72
    Mobile card height: range min 280 max 560 step 10 unit px default 390
    Mobile image height: range min 150 max 400 step 10 unit px default 250
    Desktop card width: range min 20 max 60 step 5 unit vw default 30 (applied in @media min-width:750px)
    Card gap: range min 10 max 50 step 2 unit px default 20
    Card background: color default #FFFFFF
    Card border radius: range min 0 max 80 step 2 unit px default 36
    Image border radius: range min 0 max 80 step 2 unit px default 24
    Shadow opacity: range min 0 max 50 step 5 default 10 → use divided_by:100.0 in Liquid for CSS
    Title font picker default serif, size range min 14 max 48 step 2 unit px default 22, color default #000000
    Description show/hide checkbox default false, font picker default sans-serif, size range min 12 max 24 step 1 unit px default 14, color default #666666
    Button text (collections) text default "Ver colección", font picker default sans-serif, size range min 10 max 24 step 1 unit px default 13, bg color default #000000, text color default #FFFFFF, hover bg default #383838, hover text default #FFFFFF, border radius range min 0 max 80 step 2 unit px default 0
    JS: customElements.define with unique name from block.id. connectedCallback: get track + cards, run updateScales() in rAF, attach scroll listener. updateScales(): rAF loop → per card compute distance from track center → apply scale + opacity. Scroll listener: call updateScales() each event + debounce 150ms → snapToNearest(). snapToNearest(): find card closest to center, scrollBy({behavior:'smooth'}), isSnapping=true, release after 400ms.
    
    SCHEMA RULES: No collection_4/5. All range defaults must satisfy (default-min) % step === 0. No decimals in range fields. OS 2.0 compatible., necesito que el heading este centrado, y opciones de personalizacion en el boton 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-collection-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: visible;
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap }}px;
    overflow-x: auto;
    overflow-y: visible;
    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;
    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
    scrollbar-width: none;
    -ms-overflow-style: none;
    padding: 20px 8vw;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}::-webkit-scrollbar {
    display: none;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    scroll-snap-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, {{ block.settings.shadow_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }});
    width: {{ block.settings.mobile_card_width }}vw;
    height: {{ block.settings.mobile_card_height }}px;
    transition: transform 0.25s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.46, 0.45, 0.94), opacity 0.25s ease;
    transform-origin: center;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-collection-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.desktop_card_width }}vw;
    }
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_height }}px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px 0 0;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    flex-grow: 1;
    align-items: {{ block.settings.title_alignment }};
    text-align: {{ block.settings.title_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.title_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.title_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.title_font.style }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.title_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.3;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.description_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.description_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.description_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.description_font.style }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    text-decoration: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    border: {{ block.settings.button_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.button_border_color }};
    font-family: {{ block.settings.button_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.button_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font.weight }};
    font-style: {{ block.settings.button_font.style }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    text-align: center;
    transition: background-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    margin-top: auto;
    {% if block.settings.button_full_width %}
      width: 100%;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-collection-carousel-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_text_color }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_border_color }};
  }
{% endstyle %}

<collection-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-collection-carousel-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-collection-carousel-track-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-track>
    {% if block.settings.collection_1 != blank %}
      <div class="ai-collection-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-card>
        {% if block.settings.collection_1.featured_image %}
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.collection_1.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.collection_1.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
            class="ai-collection-carousel-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="800"
            height="{{ block.settings.mobile_image_height }}"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div style="width: 100%; height: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_height }}px; background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px 0 0;">
            {{ 'collection-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="ai-collection-carousel-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <h3 class="ai-collection-carousel-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.collection_1.title | default: 'Colección' }}
          </h3>
          {% if block.settings.show_description and block.settings.collection_1.description != blank %}
            <p class="ai-collection-carousel-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.collection_1.description }}
            </p>
          {% endif %}
          <a href="{{ block.settings.collection_1.url }}" class="ai-collection-carousel-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.button_text_collections }}
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.collection_2 != blank %}
      <div class="ai-collection-carousel-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-card>
        {% if block.settings.collection_2.featured_image %}
          <img
            src="{{ block.settings.collection_2.featured_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
            alt="{{ block.settings.collection_2.featured_image.alt | escape }}"
            class="ai-collection-carousel-image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            loading="lazy"
            width="800"
            height="{{ block.settings.mobile_image_height }}"
          >
        {% else %}
          <div style="width: 100%; height: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_height }}px; background-color: #f4f4f4; border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px 0 0;">
            {{ 'collection-1' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}
        <div class="ai-collection-carousel-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          <h3 class="ai-collection-carousel-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.collection_2.title | default: 'Colección' }}
          </h3>
          {% if block.settings.show_description and block.settings.collection_2.description != blank %}
            <p class="ai-collection-carousel-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.collection_2.description }}
